[{"id": 380, "uuid": "167ff1b8-1804-46a9-bba4-7ef3e27183e3", "hitokoto": "流浪去吧，总会在世界的一角找到愿意懂你的人。", "type": "f", "from": "几米", "from_who": null, "creator": "xuduoyu17", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949600", "length": 22}, {"id": 381, "uuid": "2c9a64ff-25c0-4f5a-8430-3377d00077cd", "hitokoto": "我们在年少时并不知道，有些乐章一旦开始，唱的就是曲终人散。", "type": "f", "from": "九ちのセカィ", "from_who": null, "creator": "Sai", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949600", "length": 29}, {"id": 382, "uuid": "afdbb84d-bed4-4e9a-8e95-51b6b0fe13d4", "hitokoto": "故乡的云。上古的玉。随手的诗。十九岁的你。", "type": "f", "from": "可遇不可求的事", "from_who": null, "creator": "無い", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949601", "length": 21}, {"id": 383, "uuid": "994ed2d8-06c6-4bf9-8f2b-b80876616824", "hitokoto": "我敬你是条汉子！", "type": "f", "from": "论如何回答女友问题“你为什么对我这么好”", "from_who": null, "creator": "Sai", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949601", "length": 8}, {"id": 384, "uuid": "369d4d8a-1749-473d-9a07-c1001175e913", "hitokoto": "记得当时年纪小，你爱卖萌我爱笑。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "ssc1355", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949601", "length": 16}, {"id": 385, "uuid": "01220135-ef58-4844-b10a-57d5fad2cf4b", "hitokoto": "生活就像愤怒的小鸟，失败后总有几只猪在笑。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "yudezhuixun", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949601", "length": 21}, {"id": 386, "uuid": "64734ca9-1f34-43b4-b4ae-22ae3a7ba2c4", "hitokoto": "我们擦身而过，是为了相识或者遗忘。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "冰井迷音", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949601", "length": 17}, {"id": 387, "uuid": "576eefe4-7206-46ff-b2e8-88c3dedb5dd3", "hitokoto": "给我一个电话亭，我要拯救地球。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "高旺", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949601", "length": 15}, {"id": 388, "uuid": "d018d48f-4072-4736-a750-3c4856fb8077", "hitokoto": "你若盛开，清风自来。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "初忆", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949601", "length": 10}, {"id": 389, "uuid": "d6094385-4381-450a-9482-e96f4cb46174", "hitokoto": "以前高中时，羡慕大学考试只要及格就行；现在大学了，怀念高中考试及不及格都行……", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "lakesiilove", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949602", "length": 39}, {"id": 390, "uuid": "26a01750-fd36-42a8-a751-d37cbabeaed0", "hitokoto": "君子可寓意于物，但不可留意于物。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "LastFairy", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949602", "length": 16}, {"id": 391, "uuid": "b0d15a52-3f1e-49fb-9e7a-8f36701d7a76", "hitokoto": "风筝的线你随时可以放开，只是别盼望我会回来。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "Sai", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949602", "length": 22}, {"id": 392, "uuid": "108ef3b6-f55c-4144-a28b-8927820df2a0", "hitokoto": "那种亲密的人突然陌生，希望完全落空的感觉，就好像喝口凉水居然被烫到。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "Sai", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949602", "length": 34}, {"id": 394, "uuid": "74a383dc-a94b-4f84-b9a9-4c3133a00663", "hitokoto": "天空本是一种风景，可是遇见你之后，它变成了一种心情。", "type": "f", "from": "九ちのセカィ", "from_who": null, "creator": "Sai", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949602", "length": 26}, {"id": 395, "uuid": "2e183f0c-f818-4578-8021-47c374fa2e74", "hitokoto": "地球只有一个，而欧派有两个。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "mlmtmfz", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949603", "length": 14}, {"id": 396, "uuid": "22daf211-5921-47f6-82cf-771fe518ee73", "hitokoto": "成熟不是人的心变老，是泪在打转还能微笑。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "Sai", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949603", "length": 20}, {"id": 397, "uuid": "609c6789-fb47-4d7b-af34-1fcbe609b0dd", "hitokoto": "等待，不是为了你能回来，而是找个借口不离开。", "type": "f", "from": "九ちのセカィ", "from_who": null, "creator": "Sai", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949603", "length": 22}, {"id": 398, "uuid": "15f4bd7e-da3a-4f4c-878a-b9d77bd4a040", "hitokoto": "最终让你难以忘怀的，并不是某个谁，而是当初为之倾心，不顾一切的自己。", "type": "f", "from": "九ちのセカィ", "from_who": null, "creator": "Sai", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949603", "length": 34}, {"id": 399, "uuid": "4ca539b4-d533-4721-85af-4c54da60b716", "hitokoto": "如果分手的恋人还能做朋友，要不从没爱过，要不还在爱着。", "type": "f", "from": "九ちのセカィ", "from_who": null, "creator": "Sai", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949603", "length": 27}, {"id": 400, "uuid": "384a97a9-6084-4b19-9f1d-6f56cb2931bb", "hitokoto": "研表究明，汉字的序顺并不定一能影阅响读，比如当你看完这句话后，才发这现里的字全是都乱的。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "吾乃外星人", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949603", "length": 44}, {"id": 401, "uuid": "417baaf9-c1a5-498f-b2c3-ac95f76af920", "hitokoto": "活着就是为了改变世界。", "type": "f", "from": "Apple", "from_who": null, "creator": "叉叉", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949604", "length": 11}, {"id": 402, "uuid": "e29245d5-ebff-4a1d-b37b-f20d88c2f6e5", "hitokoto": "H什么的最讨厌了！", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "恶魔？天使", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949604", "length": 9}, {"id": 403, "uuid": "2d3b0e40-4a87-496c-a7cd-5a3743428a23", "hitokoto": "放弃也是需要勇气的。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "世风", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949605", "length": 10}, {"id": 405, "uuid": "ec090f91-8294-44fa-9f1e-3cb8e89a6d3f", "hitokoto": "胸不平何以平天下，乳不巨何以聚人心。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "天使の心跳", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949605", "length": 18}, {"id": 406, "uuid": "cd22fb8f-55a1-4b4e-b696-262981a3dddc", "hitokoto": "忘记一个人，并非不再想起，而是偶尔想起，心中却不再有波澜。", "type": "f", "from": "九ちのセカィ", "from_who": null, "creator": "Sai", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949605", "length": 29}, {"id": 407, "uuid": "75f52946-d8a8-4a5f-acfa-923117874af0", "hitokoto": "即使无法掌握未来，也请不要忘了明天。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "leozx", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949605", "length": 18}, {"id": 408, "uuid": "06f60a39-f899-4f2b-b11e-a3411e79a844", "hitokoto": "不忘初心，方得始终。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "Nitro", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949606", "length": 10}, {"id": 409, "uuid": "7f9908c1-02dd-4c99-80da-fb4d328065a6", "hitokoto": "你制定的计划是.txt还是.exe?", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "LvionX", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949606", "length": 18}, {"id": 410, "uuid": "b5eb69b1-b565-46b4-b1b9-13e75ca70ab2", "hitokoto": "心之所愿，无所不成。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "漠伦", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949606", "length": 10}, {"id": 411, "uuid": "de3678e6-ca91-4d06-bee0-904fe4762060", "hitokoto": "无论是丢下还是被丢下，都是一样痛苦的。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "锡了个纸", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949606", "length": 19}, {"id": 412, "uuid": "65cfb785-f85b-4752-9218-5c7a1221b40b", "hitokoto": "不约，不约，叔叔我们不约~", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "月球猫", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949607", "length": 13}, {"id": 413, "uuid": "ea1f5517-6d4c-492e-a139-ceec3bb17332", "hitokoto": "既然认准这条路，何必去打听要走多久。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "zerokey", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949607", "length": 18}, {"id": 414, "uuid": "694c1696-daf8-485e-85f2-0be0255bfcd1", "hitokoto": "有些人，一旦遇见，便一眼万年；有些心动，一旦开始，便覆水难收。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "zerokey", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949607", "length": 31}, {"id": 415, "uuid": "18a1f1ee-20c1-4309-9041-4ec7429ecffa", "hitokoto": "一定是红线下得太乱，才不小心把我和你绑在一起了……却没系稳。", "type": "f", "from": "_好多虫漫画", "from_who": null, "creator": "Sai", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949607", "length": 30}, {"id": 416, "uuid": "e76de41d-d875-431d-8d1c-01b11e678c05", "hitokoto": "不敢正视你的眼睛，是怕我每一个眼神都在告白。", "type": "f", "from": "九ちのセカィ", "from_who": null, "creator": "Sai", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949607", "length": 22}, {"id": 417, "uuid": "870857f7-663f-48aa-87aa-65bf26cd6907", "hitokoto": "别人说的记在脑袋里，而自己的，则放在心里。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "Sai", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949608", "length": 21}, {"id": 418, "uuid": "9fd5c5ff-53dd-4d98-88d4-581849a8f2a9", "hitokoto": "想你想到手都断了…", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "Sai", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949609", "length": 9}, {"id": 419, "uuid": "0eea1f47-b826-4993-b2c3-e254f531e6ba", "hitokoto": "没有回忆就去创造回忆，没有道路就去开辟道路。", "type": "f", "from": "平安夜的噩梦", "from_who": null, "creator": "沙渺", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949609", "length": 22}, {"id": 420, "uuid": "09a8eca7-e241-40c9-9225-f80369bf6902", "hitokoto": "没有什么过不去，只是再也回不去。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "zerokey", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949610", "length": 16}, {"id": 421, "uuid": "0158cf66-2605-4409-892b-a999287b340f", "hitokoto": "记性太好，有时候是一种负担。容易忘记往事的人，是幸福的。", "type": "f", "from": "九ちのセカィ", "from_who": null, "creator": "Sai", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949610", "length": 28}, {"id": 422, "uuid": "e8139270-83b6-4b04-b159-c046b96a8d0d", "hitokoto": "低头不是认输，是要看清自己的路；昂头不是骄傲，是要看清自己的天空。", "type": "f", "from": "科比·布莱恩特", "from_who": null, "creator": "庄树鹏", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949610", "length": 33}, {"id": 423, "uuid": "3e6db3b0-9b3f-40bf-b652-528c67bfc4ab", "hitokoto": "我觉得，我这辈子最灿烂的笑容，大概都奉献给我电脑屏幕了。", "type": "f", "from": "bilibili", "from_who": null, "creator": "萌花残", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949610", "length": 28}, {"id": 424, "uuid": "8262f78a-f8ae-495a-bd71-6a0e98cd2f8c", "hitokoto": "有一种无奈叫做，你明明是只候鸟，却喜欢上只能给你冬天的人。", "type": "f", "from": "九ちのセカィ", "from_who": null, "creator": "Sai", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949611", "length": 29}, {"id": 425, "uuid": "663210c4-b198-4da9-913b-791831f4a213", "hitokoto": "与你的生命等价的东西，这个世界上根本没有。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "Sai", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949612", "length": 21}, {"id": 426, "uuid": "eb2e8532-b24e-4907-94cd-6dc1e0dc3d51", "hitokoto": "生活就像超级女生，走到最后的都是纯爷们。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "X", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949613", "length": 20}, {"id": 427, "uuid": "ccfc22ae-ad9f-4936-b990-534f7e7f0ac0", "hitokoto": "那天放学的时候人很多。楼道很挤，你的手不小心碰到了我的手背，这是我漫长而又短暂的初恋。", "type": "f", "from": "九ちのセカィ", "from_who": null, "creator": "Sai", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949613", "length": 43}, {"id": 428, "uuid": "80541a4b-0ef6-4a1a-9398-5e54d4562381", "hitokoto": "旅行的意义在于找到自己，而非浏览他人。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "zerokey", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949615", "length": 19}, {"id": 429, "uuid": "7043bde9-0a0f-4de8-a65a-6415890c9da0", "hitokoto": "我的小伙伴们都惊呆了！", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "矢野加奈", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949615", "length": 11}, {"id": 430, "uuid": "01e388d7-df61-48d0-9e49-95bda454a4cb", "hitokoto": "智商是硬伤。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "Sai", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949615", "length": 6}, {"id": 431, "uuid": "12308e01-1a83-4c5f-a71e-53c2a59108ac", "hitokoto": "生命太短，一秒钟都不留给让人不快的家伙。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "酷儿", "creator_uid": 6, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949615", "length": 20}, {"id": 432, "uuid": "1c70b6ca-0545-4737-ba9f-da63460a3423", "hitokoto": "XX什么的，最讨厌了！", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "kira0769", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949615", "length": 11}, {"id": 433, "uuid": "671c34ed-2878-4137-b285-5c48d03b9b9b", "hitokoto": "请叫我女王大人~", "type": "f", "from": "十万个冷笑话", "from_who": null, "creator": "Zhao.small", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949616", "length": 8}, {"id": 434, "uuid": "fb3302c7-d101-441b-96e0-48f3b80ccb5f", "hitokoto": "生活中若没有朋友，就像生活中没有阳光一样。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "能美", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949619", "length": 21}, {"id": 435, "uuid": "445c1729-4936-4041-876a-d4a7254f7d9d", "hitokoto": "二次元什么的我本来是不感冒的，直到我的膝盖中了一箭。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "智代有爱", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 