okoto": "胸部的大小并没有关系，重要的是存在于那里的温暖。", "type": "f", "from": "dreamless_milky", "from_who": null, "creator": "hsk", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949671", "length": 24}, {"id": 453, "uuid": "256c3fe2-5328-44c5-a7b2-cfed198112ef", "hitokoto": "找不到路，就自己走一条出来。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "魅影陌客", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949682", "length": 14}, {"id": 454, "uuid": "2f598faf-bc25-4578-8cd3-04e71a9f4cc6", "hitokoto": "大地母亲在忽悠着你。", "type": "f", "from": "魔兽世界", "from_who": null, "creator": "被流放de蟹子", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949725", "length": 10}, {"id": 455, "uuid": "09863e67-6a63-47f9-8196-4996bea8da4b", "hitokoto": "当世界背叛你的那天到来时，我会为你背叛全世界。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "恶魔？天使", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949746", "length": 23}, {"id": 456, "uuid": "b8bc17b5-b94d-407c-a13d-0c34cf721dcd", "hitokoto": "有些事情本身我们无法控制，只好控制自己。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "Sai", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949760", "length": 20}, {"id": 457, "uuid": "65e0d6e9-d8d3-4ad9-9e9c-b8750277a5b2", "hitokoto": "新闻联播的牛X之处在于就算你一直在换台，也能完整的看完一条新闻。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "Sai", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949790", "length": 32}, {"id": 458, "uuid": "50a227fc-be5f-4652-8c6c-d71632bdf19f", "hitokoto": "你最无暇的时光是哪段，你又把它奉献给了谁？", "type": "f", "from": "B站弹幕", "from_who": null, "creator": "王晓龙", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949801", "length": 21}, {"id": 459, "uuid": "63b6e184-1d19-4461-8736-effe551a6efb", "hitokoto": "是金子一定会发光，是银子一定会花光，是裙子一定会走光，是节操一定要丢光。", "type": "f", "from": "绝对萌域", "from_who": null, "creator": "hsk", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949807", "length": 36}, {"id": 460, "uuid": "5f98cc78-af6d-47fb-979e-da2d45d609a2", "hitokoto": "最好的感觉，是有人懂你的欲言又止。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "zerokey", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949808", "length": 17}, {"id": 461, "uuid": "eabd4dc9-8351-4ac5-aeaa-dd7e99c93361", "hitokoto": "这个城市大得让人到处能一见钟情，却没法重逢。", "type": "f", "from": "九ちのセカィ", "from_who": null, "creator": "Sai", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949863", "length": 22}, {"id": 462, "uuid": "3109b8b6-3b25-4b27-ab97-a972978a0721", "hitokoto": "只要一息尚存，就还有希望。", "type": "f", "from": "格言", "from_who": null, "creator": "漠伦", "creator_uid": 0, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1468949889", "length": 13}, {"id": 645, "uuid": "0fd68f93-632b-45b9-956b-96d13bec9873", "hitokoto": "赢了萌王，输了京介", "type": "f", "from": "萌王评语", "from_who": null, "creator": "树形图设计者", "creator_uid": 55, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1475082439", "length": 9}, {"id": 666, "uuid": "0dca9bf0-42d9-405f-b9ae-f89b40808d29", "hitokoto": "我只是五行缺驱动程序，别说我怠惰。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "树形图设计者", "creator_uid": 55, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1475617987", "length": 17}, {"id": 673, "uuid": "d0a500e9-f2ef-4262-bb7e-f489adc6915a", "hitokoto": "开心就好", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "树形图设计者", "creator_uid": 55, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1475511806", "length": 4}, {"id": 707, "uuid": "1c336d74-4418-4653-89a7-430db76ad563", "hitokoto": "值得获取的东西，就在风险的彼岸。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "″如叶般凋零。", "creator_uid": 87, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1477228966", "length": 16}, {"id": 719, "uuid": "ba9c4ac1-cc7b-45cf-bdc5-1441dc1a9de5", "hitokoto": "以前高中时，羡慕大学考试只要及格就行；现在大学了，怀念高中考试及不及格都行…", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "hitokoto", "creator_uid": 1775, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1478787580", "length": 38}, {"id": 720, "uuid": "b86a7a79-9720-492b-9ca4-d0a74ddd3ccc", "hitokoto": "我不要你忘记他 , 我只要你记得我", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "hitokoto", "creator_uid": 1775, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1478787580", "length": 17}, {"id": 728, "uuid": "68d5a6f1-5ecb-4a04-9991-4fe0df535062", "hitokoto": "为毛我的眼里常含泪水，因为我老是躺着中枪。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "hitokoto", "creator_uid": 1775, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1478787580", "length": 21}, {"id": 736, "uuid": "06a2453c-70c9-488c-8fe6-040de22c9bee", "hitokoto": "再自信的人都会觉得自己还不够好", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "hitokoto", "creator_uid": 1775, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1478787580", "length": 15}, {"id": 746, "uuid": "913ae29f-2381-46e8-9301-06b9cbf192bf", "hitokoto": "小胖子溜边走~", "type": "f", "from": "囧的呼唤", "from_who": null, "creator": "hitokoto", "creator_uid": 1775, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1478787580", "length": 7}, {"id": 788, "uuid": "992502d6-7d1b-49d5-bef9-ecd846246798", "hitokoto": "宅，是一种生活状态；死宅，是一种人生境界…", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "hitokoto", "creator_uid": 1775, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1478787580", "length": 21}, {"id": 792, "uuid": "28300930-1165-4b8d-b48c-07858ae394b7", "hitokoto": "有一个捉迷藏社团，他们团长现在还没找到。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "hitokoto", "creator_uid": 1775, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1478787580", "length": 20}, {"id": 815, "uuid": "14c0698f-0306-4d5b-acc4-b7bf4b59c89a", "hitokoto": "有家,有爱,有欧派", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "hitokoto", "creator_uid": 1775, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1478787580", "length": 9}, {"id": 841, "uuid": "56827477-4c50-4eab-bfdc-e21c0f02a59f", "hitokoto": "不论生死，好坏，对错；只要载入史册那就代表胜利——历史由胜者书写", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "hitokoto", "creator_uid": 1775, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1478787580", "length": 32}, {"id": 868, "uuid": "2f046082-44e6-4e23-978d-92f09032c756", "hitokoto": "你在我身边也好，在天边也罢，想到世界的角落有一个你，觉得整个世界也变得温柔安定了。", "type": "f", "from": "琦殿", "from_who": null, "creator": "hitokoto", "creator_uid": 1775, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1478787580", "length": 41}, {"id": 869, "uuid": "ff67e1aa-583e-41e0-9584-0bbcf41fac3c", "hitokoto": "只有懦弱和失败者才会四处寻找借口。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "hitokoto", "creator_uid": 1775, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1478787580", "length": 17}, {"id": 877, "uuid": "43bfa404-4b0e-4588-9c98-7385b554ce12", "hitokoto": "被特别在乎的人忽略，会很难过，而更难过的是你还要装作你不在乎。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "hitokoto", "creator_uid": 1775, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1478787580", "length": 31}, {"id": 881, "uuid": "9e087493-8c0b-4a2a-816b-6f24fcfe3797", "hitokoto": "如果你不能给她穿上嫁衣，请停下脱她衣服的手。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "hitokoto", "creator_uid": 1775, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1478787580", "length": 22}, {"id": 893, "uuid": "a3937652-240f-495a-a231-0a9496f24c0d", "hitokoto": "只要你想 你就是在天涯海角 我都会追去 。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "hitokoto", "creator_uid": 1775, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1478787580", "length": 21}, {"id": 911, "uuid": "93377dff-492f-45c6-ad4c-cad9488ebb67", "hitokoto": "难过从来就不能解决任何问题", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "hitokoto", "creator_uid": 1775, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1478787580", "length": 13}, {"id": 921, "uuid": "7f9a69b6-fc4a-4492-8482-59a9eac35383", "hitokoto": "人都有两面，一面天使，一面恶魔。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "hitokoto", "creator_uid": 1775, 